{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23353","headline":"有感三首 三 · 白居易","name":"有感三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往事勿追思，追思多悲怆。\n来事勿相迎，相迎已惆怅。\n不如兀然坐，不如塌然卧。\n食来即开口，睡来即合眼。\n二事最关身，安寝加餐饭。\n忘怀任行止，委命随修短。\n更若有兴来，狂歌酒一醆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}